WEBVTT

00:04.850 --> 00:07.320
<i>I worked as a salaryman 
for a toxic company,</i>

00:07.320 --> 00:09.430
<i>until I reincarnated...</i>

00:09.430 --> 00:13.710
<i>in a crazy world where everything is 
dropped by monsters in dungeons.</i>

00:14.480 --> 00:17.110
<i>In my new life, I'm level 1, 
but I have a unique skill</i>

00:17.110 --> 00:19.240
<i>that puts all of my drop rates at rank S.</i>

00:19.700 --> 00:22.030
<i>And today I'm facing off against</i>

00:23.160 --> 00:27.390
<i>a really scary monster and...</i>

00:28.080 --> 00:29.330
<i>Emily?!</i>

00:36.140 --> 00:45.230
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>

02:00.010 --> 02:05.020
<b>Kill All the Little Black Things</b>

02:11.610 --> 02:13.020
Yoda?!

02:13.020 --> 02:17.310
Don't underestimate my skill!

02:28.720 --> 02:30.830
It's over...

02:30.830 --> 02:32.340
Indeed!

02:32.340 --> 02:34.680
Cheeky, for a low-level.

02:34.680 --> 02:35.880
Thank you!

02:34.890 --> 02:36.300
That was amazing!

02:36.300 --> 02:37.630
What a man!

02:37.630 --> 02:39.100
You're the town hero!

02:49.620 --> 02:52.500
I got a weapon that shouldn't 
exist in this world

02:52.500 --> 02:55.620
from a stray, a monster that's 
not supposed to drop anything.

03:01.740 --> 03:07.160
<b>"Ryota"</b>

03:01.740 --> 03:07.160
<b>Level</b>

03:01.740 --> 03:07.160
<b>Status</b>

03:01.740 --> 03:07.160
<b>Strength</b>

03:01.740 --> 03:07.160
<b>Vitality</b>

03:01.740 --> 03:07.160
<b>Intelligence</b>

03:01.740 --> 03:07.160
<b>Will</b>

03:01.740 --> 03:07.160
<b>Speed</b>

03:01.740 --> 03:07.160
<b>Dexterity</b>

03:01.760 --> 03:07.160
<b>Luck</b>

03:03.000 --> 03:05.390
<i>I'm still at level 1,</i>

03:05.390 --> 03:07.380
<i>but thanks to the seeds I find here,</i>

03:07.380 --> 03:09.750
<i>my abilities are steadily improving.</i>

03:10.620 --> 03:14.540
<b>Nihonium Level 2</b>

03:15.260 --> 03:16.470
Okay...

03:16.760 --> 03:19.600
Let's see if this thing's 
gonna be of any use.

03:36.450 --> 03:39.410
Yeah, it's definitely a gun.

03:39.410 --> 03:41.560
It works on monsters just 
the way it should.

03:59.460 --> 04:02.160
<i>I wonder how I'm supposed 
to get more bullets.</i>

04:05.450 --> 04:08.480
<i>Will they drop from strays, too?</i>

04:08.480 --> 04:10.910
<i>I'll have to use them 
sparingly until I know.</i>

04:22.270 --> 04:23.450
Yoda!

04:29.560 --> 04:32.130
Your weapon is amazing, Yoda.

04:32.720 --> 04:34.630
I've never seen anything like it.

04:34.630 --> 04:38.420
Yeah, and my strength is 
at rank B now because of it.

04:38.420 --> 04:40.920
Let's check out the next level later.

04:40.920 --> 04:42.090
Sure!

04:42.480 --> 04:45.570
<i>As my stats increase, so does 
the range of places I can go.</i>

04:45.570 --> 04:48.880
<i>It feels good knowing there's 
something I can do!</i>

04:54.710 --> 04:56.060
She's not coming.

04:56.060 --> 04:57.550
So she isn't.

04:58.460 --> 05:01.240
Well, I guess Eve has stuff to do, too.

05:01.580 --> 05:04.080
She can't just show up every day.

05:04.080 --> 05:06.900
We'll save these carrots 
for her, just in case.

05:06.900 --> 05:09.890
Yeah. She might still show up at the house.

05:11.870 --> 05:16.660
Anyway, the lunches you make 
are still the best, Emily!

05:23.220 --> 05:25.130
Have some tea, too.

05:26.700 --> 05:27.970
Thanks.

05:31.060 --> 05:32.720
This is so... I don't know...

05:33.520 --> 05:35.220
Relaxing.

05:39.670 --> 05:42.510
Have you been down here before?

05:42.510 --> 05:43.710
No.

05:44.020 --> 05:47.510
I only know the names of the 
monsters here and what they drop.

05:47.880 --> 05:50.190
The monsters are cockroslimes,

05:50.190 --> 05:52.490
and they drop pumpkins.

05:52.490 --> 05:54.650
Slimes again?

05:54.650 --> 05:57.040
I look forward to meals made 
with pumpkin, though.

06:04.530 --> 06:07.050
So those are cockroslimes?

06:07.050 --> 06:10.320
I bet girls would run away 
screaming from these.

06:10.320 --> 06:12.520
I mean, they look just like cockroa—

06:17.920 --> 06:21.620
E-Emily, I don't think you 
needed to go <i>that</i> hard...

06:21.620 --> 06:24.450
What are you talking about, Yoda?

06:26.890 --> 06:30.600
The tragedy will only grow 
more widespread if I don't.

06:30.600 --> 06:31.990
Not relaxing anymore!

06:32.940 --> 06:35.570
I can't allow any to escape.

06:37.300 --> 06:39.630
Um... Emily?

06:45.760 --> 06:46.970
Hey, a drop.

06:47.830 --> 06:49.240
I did it!

06:52.150 --> 06:54.550
Well, we killed the cockroslimes.

06:54.550 --> 06:56.170
Let's go up and get more carrots.

06:56.170 --> 06:57.090
Okay!

07:02.900 --> 07:05.110
<i>We gotta get out of here, fast.</i>

07:05.110 --> 07:08.330
<i>I don't want to see that 
scary version of Emily again.</i>

07:18.340 --> 07:21.700
For every one you see...

07:22.310 --> 07:28.890
you have to assume there are 
thirty more you can't see!

07:31.340 --> 07:38.040
Yoda... I might never regain my humanity!

07:38.040 --> 07:39.770
Don't be hasty! Let me do it!

07:40.340 --> 07:43.200
Just let me take care of everything here!

07:43.640 --> 07:47.480
I'm begging you! Please let 
me take care of this!

07:48.900 --> 07:52.100
<i>I can't miss a single shot!</i>

07:55.670 --> 08:01.710
<i>Have I ever concentrated so intently 
on anything in all my life?</i>

08:02.610 --> 08:04.680
<i>No... I haven't.</i>

08:05.170 --> 08:08.830
They're so big! You've done it again, Yoda!

08:08.830 --> 08:12.590
Yeah, but we can't take all these upstairs.

08:14.880 --> 08:17.850
Those things will spawn 
again if we stay here.

08:17.850 --> 08:19.220
You want to kill them again?

08:19.220 --> 08:21.990
O-Okay, just calm down for a minute...

08:28.610 --> 08:31.810
Low-Level, I'm here for today's carrots.

08:33.010 --> 08:34.130
Help yourself.

08:38.900 --> 08:40.680
I-I'm saved...

08:47.170 --> 08:49.130
Thank you as always!

08:49.130 --> 08:50.930
We'll make a few more trips with the rest.

08:50.930 --> 08:53.020
Okay. I'll be waiting.

09:03.610 --> 09:04.780
Aw, man.

09:05.490 --> 09:08.280
I guess some animal got to them.

09:08.280 --> 09:10.870
We can't sell these.

09:12.400 --> 09:14.240
They're here...

09:21.870 --> 09:24.490
But how?! We're outside the dungeon!

09:24.810 --> 09:28.910
I have lived my entire life for this moment.

09:28.910 --> 09:30.920
You're getting a little intense there!

09:48.890 --> 09:53.100
I'll do it! I'll kill them, okay?!

09:57.430 --> 09:58.960
Give her back!

09:58.960 --> 10:02.440
Give me my Emily back!

10:06.600 --> 10:09.160
I did it. I killed them all.

10:09.160 --> 10:11.080
I'm sorry.

10:11.300 --> 10:15.400
I guess I turn into someone 
else when I see those things.

10:15.750 --> 10:18.130
It's not your fault, Emily.

10:32.840 --> 10:34.940
You didn't know?

10:34.940 --> 10:39.060
If you leave dropped items behind 
where there are no people around,

10:39.060 --> 10:42.110
monsters spawn around them.

10:42.650 --> 10:47.280
<i>I think Emily told me something like 
that when the gorilla showed up,</i>

10:47.280 --> 10:49.250
<i>but it didn't even register.</i>

10:50.160 --> 10:53.470
Yeah, and they ruined the 
last of our pumpkins.

10:53.740 --> 10:56.240
Sorry. I know you were waiting for them.

10:56.240 --> 10:59.630
No problem. We're still open, anyway.

10:59.630 --> 11:01.880
We will be closing soon, though.

11:01.880 --> 11:06.970
<i>So it's possible to force strays to spawn?</i>

11:03.890 --> 11:07.800
Um, Ryota, if you don't mind...

11:06.970 --> 11:08.230
That means...

11:08.230 --> 11:12.030
Would you like to g-g-go out for dinner?

11:13.170 --> 11:17.190
I found a great restaurant, 
and I thought—

11:16.110 --> 11:17.640
Thanks, Erza!

11:18.230 --> 11:19.510
I'll be back!

11:21.320 --> 11:22.900
What?!

11:25.380 --> 11:26.870
<i>Once I get an idea,</i>

11:26.870 --> 11:29.150
<i>I have to act on it right away.</i>

11:30.470 --> 11:33.270
<i>I got this carrot in Telulu earlier.</i>

11:33.270 --> 11:34.820
<i>Is this gonna work?</i>

11:41.160 --> 11:43.660
<i>You</i> took the bait?!

11:44.490 --> 11:45.800
Hey! That carrot—

11:45.800 --> 11:48.200
This carrot is for a rabbit!

11:48.640 --> 11:53.970
Even if Heaven and Earth switch places,
 I won't give it up!

11:53.970 --> 11:57.400
It's the longest sentence I've heard 
you say, and it was to say <i>that?!</i>

11:57.970 --> 11:59.830
<i>Starting over...</i>

12:00.740 --> 12:03.380
<i>Good thing I got so many of these.</i>

12:03.380 --> 12:06.580
<i>I can't believe she took 
nine out of ten, though...</i>

12:09.000 --> 12:10.500
Here we go!

12:18.880 --> 12:20.230
It worked!

12:24.740 --> 12:28.040
They say strays don't drop anything,

12:28.460 --> 12:30.150
but for me...

12:33.760 --> 12:34.810
Hang on...

12:41.060 --> 12:44.190
What if I did this with those guys?

12:45.160 --> 12:46.910
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>

12:45.160 --> 12:46.910
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>

12:47.140 --> 12:49.050
Boing.

12:50.080 --> 12:53.550
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>

12:50.080 --> 12:53.550
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>

12:53.550 --> 12:55.070
Emily!

13:01.010 --> 13:04.670
<b>Nihonium Level 1</b>

13:04.670 --> 13:08.210
m 0 0 l -40 0 l -44 -4 l -44 -27 l -40 -31 l -26 -31 l -26 -29 l -40 -29 l -42 -27 l -42 -4 l -40 -2 l 0 -2

13:04.670 --> 13:08.210
m 0 0 l -40 0 l -44 -4 l -44 -27 l -40 -31 l -26 -31 l -26 -29 l -40 -29 l -42 -27 l -42 -4 l -40 -2 l 0 -2

13:04.670 --> 13:08.640
Ryota's max HP increased by 0.

13:05.100 --> 13:08.130
<i>Ryota's max HP increased by 0.</i>

13:09.780 --> 13:12.200
No matter how many times 
I try, they just vanish.

13:15.140 --> 13:18.960
Turning monsters with no drops into 
strays, then killing them...

13:19.420 --> 13:21.380
With my unique skill,

13:21.380 --> 13:23.510
it seems like something 
interesting should happen...

13:25.240 --> 13:29.740
m 0 0 l -40 0 l -44 -4 l -44 -27 l -40 -31 l -26 -31 l -26 -29 l -40 -29 l -42 -27 l -42 -4 l -40 -2 l 0 -2

13:25.240 --> 13:29.740
m 0 0 l -40 0 l -44 -4 l -44 -27 l -40 -31 l -26 -31 l -26 -29 l -40 -29 l -42 -27 l -42 -4 l -40 -2 l 0 -2

13:25.240 --> 13:29.740
Ryota's max HP increased by 0.

13:25.670 --> 13:28.790
<i>Ryota's max HP increased by 0.</i>

13:30.430 --> 13:33.540
<i>Since my HP's already maxed out,</i>

13:33.540 --> 13:38.630
<i>I thought I'd be able to carry the 
seeds back without consuming them...</i>

13:39.730 --> 13:41.950
<i>But I guess that won't work.</i>

13:44.220 --> 13:46.750
I'll just meet up with Emily in Telulu

13:46.750 --> 13:49.710
and work hard to hunt down 
today's supply of drops.

14:02.430 --> 14:04.850
<i>Damn! It'll turn into a stray!</i>

14:04.850 --> 14:07.370
<i>No, actually, that's fine!</i>

14:09.460 --> 14:10.470
Huh?

14:16.860 --> 14:20.920
Monsters disappear if they leave a dungeon.

14:20.920 --> 14:24.680
We'd have strays all over 
the place otherwise.

14:24.680 --> 14:26.430
So that's how it works.

14:26.430 --> 14:29.790
Even within a dungeon, they disappear 
if they enter a different floor.

14:29.790 --> 14:34.020
That's why there's only one type 
of monster on each floor.

14:34.020 --> 14:35.520
I see.

14:35.890 --> 14:39.180
You're a very talented adventurer,

14:39.180 --> 14:41.940
but there's a surprising 
amount you don't know.

14:42.470 --> 14:48.790
Still, I think the contrast is... 
k-kind of charming... or...

14:48.790 --> 14:49.900
Thanks, Erza!

14:49.900 --> 14:50.610
Huh?!

14:50.610 --> 14:51.690
I'll be back!

14:52.510 --> 14:54.700
Darn it!

14:55.020 --> 14:57.560
Ryota, you jerk!

15:02.830 --> 15:07.110
<i>If my guess is right, this should work.</i>

15:09.340 --> 15:10.270
<i>There's one!</i>

15:13.610 --> 15:15.440
<i>Just like before...</i>

15:15.850 --> 15:18.300
<i>I have just a moment before it disappears.</i>

15:18.760 --> 15:20.940
<i>If I kill it within that moment...</i>

15:25.790 --> 15:27.300
It worked!

15:27.900 --> 15:31.940
If I kill it outside its floor, 
it should count as a stray!

15:31.940 --> 15:34.540
<i>Ryota acquired a freezing bullet.</i>

15:34.540 --> 15:35.790
A freezing bullet?

15:51.430 --> 15:53.480
This is incredible!

15:53.740 --> 15:57.110
Depending on how I use them, 
I could do a lot with these!

16:08.090 --> 16:09.100
Now, Emily!

16:09.100 --> 16:10.330
Got it!

16:20.150 --> 16:23.580
Freeze it in place, then hit 
it with a powerful attack.

16:23.580 --> 16:27.380
It's a combo often used in games, 
and it looks like we can do it here, too.

16:27.380 --> 16:29.910
Yoda, that was amazing.

16:29.910 --> 16:33.550
What was... What was that, exactly?

16:33.550 --> 16:37.530
Just what it looked like. 
A bullet that freezes whatever it hits.

16:38.210 --> 16:40.580
It takes time to get them, though,

16:40.580 --> 16:42.320
so I can't fire a lot in succession.

16:43.270 --> 16:45.190
They're quite valuable.

16:46.040 --> 16:50.000
Yeah. So I'll stick with the regular 
bullets unless it's an emergency.

16:50.000 --> 16:52.440
You can just finish off the ones I miss.

16:54.240 --> 16:55.760
Understood!

17:14.680 --> 17:17.540
Looks like it's rained recently.

17:17.540 --> 17:19.180
Watch your step.

17:19.180 --> 17:20.880
Same to you.

17:21.230 --> 17:22.150
I will.

17:23.100 --> 17:24.800
Get it up here already!

17:25.300 --> 17:27.010
Don't be crazy!

17:27.730 --> 17:30.220
You fool!

17:28.740 --> 17:30.220
Are they fighting?

17:30.220 --> 17:31.850
Say what?!

17:31.850 --> 17:34.780
Excuse me. We'd like to get past.

17:34.780 --> 17:37.260
Oh, you'll do.

17:37.260 --> 17:39.560
Pull that cargo up for me.

17:39.560 --> 17:42.120
This fool will pay you.

17:42.120 --> 17:43.350
What?!

17:43.660 --> 17:45.140
<i>What in the...</i>

17:45.140 --> 17:46.840
Cargo?

17:52.120 --> 17:54.030
You mean that?

17:54.030 --> 17:58.700
Uh... If someone could drop 
a rope to climb down,

17:58.700 --> 18:02.510
I could probably get it, 
though it wouldn't be easy...

18:02.510 --> 18:03.880
Don't!

18:03.880 --> 18:06.780
It's been quite a while since it fell.

18:08.540 --> 18:10.660
It might turn into a stray, then!

18:12.700 --> 18:16.880
That thing's loaded with drops 
from some troublesome monsters.

18:16.880 --> 18:19.690
We have to burn it up with 
magic while we still can.

18:20.260 --> 18:21.690
No!

18:22.260 --> 18:23.530
Hey, watch it!

18:23.530 --> 18:26.150
That perfume will sell for a fortune!

18:26.150 --> 18:31.710
Do you have any idea how many adventurers 
I hired to collect that much of it?!

18:31.950 --> 18:33.600
You think I care?!

18:34.240 --> 18:36.840
Besides, you're the one who dropped it!

18:36.840 --> 18:39.030
The rain made you slip and lose it!

18:39.030 --> 18:42.210
Well, you... are fired!

18:44.650 --> 18:46.280
Huh?!

18:46.280 --> 18:48.700
That's one very powerful old man!

18:50.030 --> 18:51.560
I was too late.

18:52.260 --> 18:53.610
What's that?

18:53.610 --> 18:55.740
A monster called a femini.

18:55.740 --> 18:57.090
It doesn't have its own body.

18:57.090 --> 19:00.230
It possesses a human and uses it 
as a nursery to propagate itself.

19:01.600 --> 19:04.320
Well, it's worth a try!

19:15.670 --> 19:16.940
It worked!

19:19.120 --> 19:20.790
Take him and run!

19:20.790 --> 19:21.630
Huh?

19:21.970 --> 19:24.400
Hey! What are you gonna do?!

19:24.870 --> 19:28.780
If I don't do something, femini are 
gonna pop out in all directions.

19:30.300 --> 19:32.730
If I go down there and become a nursery,

19:32.730 --> 19:36.220
I can buy time while you gather an army in town.

19:36.650 --> 19:38.560
But what will happen to you?

19:38.830 --> 19:42.480
As the one hired to serve as 
the escort on this mission,

19:42.480 --> 19:44.540
the responsibility for 
this accident is mine.

19:48.360 --> 19:52.440
Oh, boy, you've done it now.

19:52.950 --> 19:56.010
The client's furious, y'know.

19:56.010 --> 19:59.390
I'm sorry. I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

19:59.680 --> 20:02.290
Gotta start all over now, huh?

20:02.290 --> 20:06.340
You're not gonna get any sleep 
for five days, but good luck!

20:06.340 --> 20:07.300
Yes, sir.

20:07.300 --> 20:10.340
Man, I could never survive that.

20:12.570 --> 20:14.720
U-Uh...

20:15.260 --> 20:18.620
It was my mistake, so the 
responsibility is mine.

20:19.430 --> 20:22.700
You have your own work to do, Sato-senpai.

20:25.400 --> 20:28.440
<i>I really did want to help.</i>

20:28.980 --> 20:32.820
<i>But in the end, all I could 
think about was myself.</i>

20:36.240 --> 20:38.120
What are you doing?! Run away now!

20:38.120 --> 20:40.750
No! Let me help!

20:41.110 --> 20:43.530
<i>It's not like that anymore.</i>

20:47.380 --> 20:49.980
<i>The whole reason I'm gaining more abilities</i>

20:49.980 --> 20:52.130
<i>is for times like these!</i>

21:10.750 --> 21:13.370
Emily! You okay?!

21:17.060 --> 21:18.830
Just like before...

21:19.140 --> 21:20.690
I did it right!

21:24.750 --> 21:27.410
Thank you. You saved us.

21:31.640 --> 21:38.060
<b>"Emily" 
Level 20/40 
Status 
HP                 B
MP                F
Strength       A 
Vitality         C 
Intelligence  F 
Will              F 
Speed           E 
Dexterity     F</b>

21:33.170 --> 21:35.360
Your level went way up!

21:35.360 --> 21:38.050
It sure did! I could feel it!

21:38.290 --> 21:41.400
I guess femini are really strong monsters.

21:41.840 --> 21:44.460
If you take out that many of them at once,

21:44.460 --> 21:46.280
of course your level's gonna go up.

21:46.650 --> 21:48.910
It's all thanks to you.

21:48.910 --> 21:51.800
If I stay with you,

21:51.800 --> 21:54.290
I'm sure more good things will happen.

21:55.230 --> 21:57.610
Nah, I'm the one...

21:58.120 --> 21:59.890
getting nothing but good things from this.

21:59.890 --> 22:03.830
Oh, you are, too? So we're the same!
